		"html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Four numbers, one deformation</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}\n  body{\n    background:#f2f5fa;color:#1b2437;\n    font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n    padding:16px;\n  }\n  .app{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;}\n  h1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 3px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}\n  .sub{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13.5px;color:#5a667d;}\n  .main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 296px;gap:14px;align-items:start;}\n  @media (max-width:840px){ .main{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }\n\n  .stage{position:relative;height:540px;background:#0b1020;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;\n         box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(20,30,60,0.22);}\n  @media (max-width:840px){ .stage{height:420px;} }\n  canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair;}\n  .hint-overlay{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:10px;pointer-events:none;\n    font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.02em;color:rgba(220,232,255,0.62);\n    background:rgba(8,12,22,0.55);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);\n    padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;}\n\n  .readout{margin-top:10px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 14px;\n    box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(20,30,60,0.09);}\n  .detrow{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .dettag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.09em;text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:#5a667d;background:#eef2f9;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 7px;}\n  .detval{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1b2437;}\n  .detformula{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    font-size:12.5px;color:#7c879c;}\n  .status{margin-top:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}\n  .status.ok{color:#0d7a4d;}\n  .status.flip{color:#9a5a00;}\n  .status.collapsed{color:#b3261e;font-weight:800;}\n  .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin-top:9px;\n    font-size:11.5px;color:#5a667d;}\n  .chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}\n  .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;}\n\n  .panel{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(20,30,60,0.10);}\n  .matrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}\n  .matname{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#465268;}\n  .matrix{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto;gap:4px 20px;\n    position:relative;padding:6px 14px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    font-size:19px;font-weight:700;}\n  .matrix::before,.matrix::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:8px;\n    border:2px solid #9aa7bd;}\n  .matrix::before{left:0;border-right:none;border-radius:4px 0 0 4px;}\n  .matrix::after{right:0;border-left:none;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;}\n  .matrix span{display:block;min-width:44px;text-align:center;line-height:1.35;}\n  .c1{color:#d6356f;}\n  .c2{color:#0e79ad;}\n  .hint{font-size:11.5px;color:#6b7790;margin:8px 0 12px;line-height:1.45;}\n\n  .srow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px minmax(0,1fr) 42px;align-items:center;\n    gap:8px;margin-bottom:7px;}\n  .srow label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.15;}\n  .srow .k{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;}\n  .srow .pos{font-size:9.5px;color:#93a0b5;letter-spacing:0.02em;}\n  input[type=range]{width:100%;height:22px;margin:0;background:transparent;\n    -webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;}\n  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#e3e9f3;}\n  input[type=range]::-moz-range-track{height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#e3e9f3;}\n  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;\n    width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;margin-top:-5.5px;background:#fff;\n    border:3px solid var(--accent,#3b4a63);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,30,60,0.28);}\n  input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--accent,#3b4a63);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,30,60,0.28);}\n  input[type=range]:focus{outline:none;}\n  input[type=range]:focus-visible::-webkit-slider-thumb{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(59,74,99,0.18);}\n  .srow output{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    font-size:12.5px;color:#3a475f;text-align:right;font-weight:700;}\n\n  .presets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:13px;}\n  .pbtn{font:inherit;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#2c3a52;background:#f1f5fb;\n    border:1px solid #dde5f1;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 5px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.2;\n    transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,transform .06s;}\n  .pbtn:hover{background:#e6eefa;border-color:#c8d6ea;}\n  .pbtn:active{transform:translateY(1px);}\n  .probe-readout{margin-top:13px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f8;\n    font-size:12.5px;color:#5a667d;line-height:1.7;}\n  .probe-readout b{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;\n    color:#1b2437;font-size:12.5px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <h1>Four numbers, one deformation</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">A matrix <em>is</em> a transformation of the plane. Its columns are where the basis vectors land.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n        <canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"hint-overlay\">drag anywhere to move the probe&nbsp;<b>x</b></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"readout\">\n        <div class=\"detrow\">\n          <span class=\"dettag\">det A</span>\n          <span class=\"detval\" id=\"detval\">1.00</span>\n          <span class=\"detformula\" id=\"detformula\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"status ok\" id=\"status\">area scaled by |det| = 1.00</div>\n        <div class=\"legend\">\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ff5f96\"></i>col 1 = A e₁</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3fc7ff\"></i>col 2 = A e₂</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b9a6fd\"></i>image of unit square</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ffc247\"></i>probe x</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#5cf08a\"></i>Ax</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"matrow\">\n        <span class=\"matname\">A =</span>\n        <div class=\"matrix\">\n          <span class=\"c1\" id=\"ma\">1.0</span>\n          <span class=\"c2\" id=\"mb\">1.0</span>\n          <span class=\"c1\" id=\"mc\">0.0</span>\n          <span class=\"c2\" id=\"md\">1.0</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\"><b class=\"c1\">Left column</b> = where e₁ lands · <b class=\"c2\">right column</b> = where e₂ lands.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"sliders\">\n        <div class=\"srow\"><label for=\"sa\"><span class=\"k c1\">a</span><span class=\"pos\">row 1 · col 1</span></label>\n          <input id=\"sa\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\" style=\"--accent:#d6356f\">\n          <output id=\"oa\">1.0</output></div>\n        <div class=\"srow\"><label for=\"sb\"><span class=\"k c2\">b</span><span class=\"pos\">row 1 · col 2</span></label>\n          <input id=\"sb\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\" style=\"--accent:#0e79ad\">\n          <output id=\"ob\">1.0</output></div>\n        <div class=\"srow\"><label for=\"sc\"><span class=\"k c1\">c</span><span class=\"pos\">row 2 · col 1</span></label>\n          <input id=\"sc\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" style=\"--accent:#d6356f\">\n          <output id=\"oc\">0.0</output></div>\n        <div class=\"srow\"><label for=\"sd\"><span class=\"k c2\">d</span><span class=\"pos\">row 2 · col 2</span></label>\n          <input id=\"sd\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\" style=\"--accent:#0e79ad\">\n          <output id=\"od\">1.0</output></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"presets\">\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"shear\">shear</button>\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"rotate\">rotate 90°</button>\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"project\">project onto x-axis</button>\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"scale2\">scale 2</button>\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"reflect\">reflect across y = x</button>\n        <button class=\"pbtn\" data-preset=\"collapse\">collapse (det = 0)</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"probe-readout\">\n        <div>x = <b id=\"pxv\">(1.50, 0.50)</b></div>\n        <div>Ax = <b id=\"axv\">(2.00, 0.50)</b></div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  /* ---------------- state ---------------- */\n  const A = { a:1, b:1, c:0, d:1 };\n  const probe = { x:1.5, y:0.5 };\n  let tween = null;\n  let dirty = true;\n\n  const cv = document.getElementById('cv');\n  const ctx = cv.getContext('2d');\n  const stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n\n  let W = 600, H = 540, DPR = 1, scale = 60, ox = 300, oy = 270;\n\n  const C = {\n    grid:      'rgba(126,172,255,0.26)',\n    gridAxis:  'rgba(160,200,255,0.50)',\n    c1:        '#ff5f96',\n    c2:        '#3fc7ff',\n    par:       'rgba(167,139,250,0.20)',\n    parEdge:   'rgba(196,181,253,0.95)',\n    probe:     '#ffc247',\n    image:     '#5cf08a',\n    ghost:     'rgba(255,255,255,0.50)'\n  };\n\n  const els = {\n    ma:document.getElementById('ma'), mb:document.getElementById('mb'),\n    mc:document.getElementById('mc'), md:document.getElementById('md'),\n    sa:document.getElementById('sa'), sb:document.getElementById('sb'),\n    sc:document.getElementById('sc'), sd:document.getElementById('sd'),\n    oa:document.getElementById('oa'), ob:document.getElementById('ob'),\n    oc:document.getElementById('oc'), od:document.getElementById('od'),\n    detval:document.getElementById('detval'), detformula:document.getElementById('detformula'),\n    status:document.getElementById('status'),\n    pxv:document.getElementById('pxv'), axv:document.getElementById('axv')\n  };\n\n  /* ---------------- geometry helpers ---------------- */\n  function tf(x, y){ return [A.a*x + A.b*y, A.c*x + A.d*y]; }\n  function w2s(x, y){ return [ox + x*scale, oy - y*scale]; }\n  function s2w(px, py){ return [ (px - ox)/scale, (oy - py)/scale ]; }\n  function det(){ return A.a*A.d - A.b*A.c; }\n\n  /* ---------------- sizing ---------------- */\n  function resize(){\n    const r = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const w = Math.max(260, Math.round(r.width));\n    const h = Math.max(240, Math.round(r.height));\n    DPR = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n    W = w; H = h;\n    cv.width  = Math.round(w * DPR);\n    cv.height = Math.round(h * DPR);\n    ctx.setTransform(DPR, 0, 0, DPR, 0, 0);\n    scale = Math.min(w, h) / 8.6;\n    ox = w / 2; oy = h / 2;\n    dirty = true;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- drawing primitives ---------------- */\n  function roundRect(x, y, w, h, r){\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    if (ctx.roundRect){ ctx.roundRect(x, y, w, h, r); return; }\n    ctx.moveTo(x+r, y);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y, x+w, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x+w, y+h, x, y+h, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y+h, x, y, r);\n    ctx.arcTo(x, y, x+w, y, r);\n    ctx.closePath();\n  }\n\n  function drawArrowPx(x1, y1, x2, y2, color, width, dash, headLen){\n    headLen = headLen || 12;\n    const dx = x2 - x1, dy = y2 - y1;\n    const len = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n    ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n    ctx.fillStyle = color;\n    ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n    ctx.lineWidth = width;\n    if (len < 1.5){\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(x2, y2, Math.max(3, width), 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n      return;\n    }\n    const ux = dx/len, uy = dy/len;\n    const hl = Math.min(headLen, len * 0.55);\n    const bx = x2 - ux*hl, by = y2 - uy*hl;\n    ctx.setLineDash(dash || []);\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x1, y1); ctx.lineTo(bx, by); ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.setLineDash([]);\n    const hw = hl * 0.46;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(x2, y2);\n    ctx.lineTo(bx - uy*hw, by + ux*hw);\n    ctx.lineTo(bx + uy*hw, by - ux*hw);\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fill();\n  }\n\n  function drawArrow(x1, y1, x2, y2, color, width, dash, headLen){\n    const p = w2s(x1, y1), q = w2s(x2, y2);\n    drawArrowPx(p[0], p[1], q[0], q[1], color, width, dash, headLen);\n  }\n\n  function pillLabel(sx, sy, text, color, borderColor){\n    ctx.font = '700 12.5px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif';\n    const tw = ctx.measureText(text).width;\n    const padX = 7, h = 21;\n    let x = sx - tw/2 - padX;\n    let y = sy - h/2;\n    x = Math.max(4, Math.min(W - tw - 2*padX - 4, x));\n    y = Math.max(4, Math.min(H - h - 4, y));\n    roundRect(x, y, tw + 2*padX, h, 6);\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(8,12,22,0.86)';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = borderColor || 'rgba(255,255,255,0.16)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.fillStyle = color;\n    ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n    ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n    ctx.fillText(text, x + padX, y + h/2 + 0.5);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- layers ---------------- */\n  function drawOriginalGrid(){\n    const wl = (0 - ox)/scale, wr = (W - ox)/scale;\n    const wt = (oy - 0)/scale,  wb = (oy - H)/scale;\n\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.055)';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let k = Math.ceil(wl); k <= Math.floor(wr); k++){\n      const sx = w2s(k, 0)[0];\n      ctx.moveTo(sx, 0); ctx.lineTo(sx, H);\n    }\n    for (let k = Math.ceil(wb); k <= Math.floor(wt); k++){\n      const sy = w2s(0, k)[1];\n      ctx.moveTo(0, sy); ctx.lineTo(W, sy);\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // original axes\n    const o = w2s(0, 0);\n    const x0 = o[0], y0 = o[1];\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.22)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.4;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(0, y0); ctx.lineTo(W, y0);\n    ctx.moveTo(x0, 0); ctx.lineTo(x0, H);\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // tick numbers\n    ctx.font = '600 10px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace';\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(210,225,250,0.34)';\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n    ctx.textBaseline = 'top';\n    for (let k = Math.ceil(wl); k <= Math.floor(wr); k++){\n      if (k === 0 || Math.abs(k) > 12) continue;\n      ctx.fillText(String(k), w2s(k, 0)[0], y0 + 6);\n    }\n    ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n    ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n    for (let k = Math.ceil(wb); k <= Math.floor(wt); k++){\n      if (k === 0 || Math.abs(k) > 12) continue;\n      ctx.fillText(String(k), x0 - 6, w2s(0, k)[1]);\n    }\n\n    // axis names\n    ctx.font = '700 13px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(215,230,255,0.55)';\n    ctx.textAlign = 'right'; ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n    ctx.fillText('x', W - 10, y0 - 13);\n    ctx.textAlign = 'left'; ctx.textBaseline = 'top';\n    ctx.fillText('y', x0 + 9, 9);\n  }\n\n  function gridRanges(){\n    const corners = [ s2w(0,0), s2w(W,0), s2w(0,H), s2w(W,H) ];\n    let kmin, kmax, mmin, mmax;\n    const D = det();\n    if (Math.abs(D) > 1e-4){\n      const ia =  A.d/D, ib = -A.b/D;\n      const ic = -A.c/D, id =  A.a/D;\n      const us = corners.map(function(p){ return ia*p[0] + ib*p[1]; });\n      const vs = corners.map(function(p){ return ic*p[0] + id*p[1]; });\n      kmin = Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, us)) - 1;\n      kmax = Math.ceil (Math.max.apply(null, us)) + 1;\n      mmin = Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, vs)) - 1;\n      mmax = Math.ceil (Math.max.apply(null, vs)) + 1;\n    } else {\n      kmin = -26; kmax = 26; mmin = -26; mmax = 26;\n    }\n    const CAP = 70;\n    kmin = Math.max(kmin, -CAP); kmax = Math.min(kmax, CAP);\n    mmin = Math.max(mmin, -CAP); mmax = Math.min(mmax, CAP);\n    if (kmax < kmin){ kmax = kmin; }\n    if (mmax < mmin){ mmax = mmin; }\n    return { kmin:kmin, kmax:kmax, mmin:mmin, mmax:mmax };\n  }\n\n  function drawTransformedGrid(){\n    const g = gridRanges();\n    const Ty = Math.max(Math.abs(g.mmin), Math.abs(g.mmax)) + 2;\n    const Tx = Math.max(Math.abs(g.kmin), Math.abs(g.kmax)) + 2;\n\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.rect(0, 0, W, H);\n    ctx.clip();\n\n    ctx.strokeStyle = C.grid;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.1;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let k = g.kmin; k <= g.kmax; k++){\n      const p1 = tf(k, -Ty), p2 = tf(k, Ty);\n      const s1 = w2s(p1[0], p1[1]), s2 = w2s(p2[0], p2[1]);\n      ctx.moveTo(s1[0], s1[1]);\n      ctx.lineTo(s2[0], s2[1]);\n    }\n    for (let m = g.mmin; m <= g.mmax; m++){\n      const p1 = tf(-Tx, m), p2 = tf(Tx, m);\n      const s1 = w2s(p1[0], p1[1]), s2 = w2s(p2[0], p2[1]);\n      ctx.moveTo(s1[0], s1[1]);\n      ctx.lineTo(s2[0], s2[1]);\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // highlight the images of the original axes (x = 0 -> span of col2, y = 0 -> span of col1)\n    ctx.strokeStyle = C.gridAxis;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.6;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    let p1 = tf(0, -Ty), p2 = tf(0, Ty);\n    let s1 = w2s(p1[0], p1[1]), s2 = w2s(p2[0], p2[1]);\n    ctx.moveTo(s1[0], s1[1]); ctx.lineTo(s2[0], s2[1]);\n    p1 = tf(-Tx, 0); p2 = tf(Tx, 0);\n    s1 = w2s(p1[0], p1[1]); s2 = w2s(p2[0], p2[1]);\n    ctx.moveTo(s1[0], s1[1]); ctx.lineTo(s2[0], s2[1]);\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  function drawGhostSquare(){\n    const pts = [[0,0],[1,0],[1,1],[0,1]];\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.setLineDash([6, 5]);\n    ctx.strokeStyle = C.ghost;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1.6;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let i = 0; i < pts.length; i++){\n      const s = w2s(pts[i][0], pts[i][1]);\n      if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(s[0], s[1]); else ctx.lineTo(s[0], s[1]);\n    }\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  function drawParallelogram(){\n    const c1 = [A.a, A.c];\n    const c2 = [A.b, A.d];\n    const corners = [ [0,0], c1, [c1[0]+c2[0], c1[1]+c2[1]], c2 ];\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++){\n      const s = w2s(corners[i][0], corners[i][1]);\n      if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(s[0], s[1]); else ctx.lineTo(s[0], s[1]);\n    }\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fillStyle = C.par;\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = C.parEdge;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    ctx.lineJoin = 'round';\n    ctx.stroke();\n  }\n\n  function drawBasisGhosts(){\n    drawArrow(0, 0, 1, 0, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.34)', 2, [4,4], 9);\n    drawArrow(0, 0, 0, 1, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.34)', 2, [4,4], 9);\n    const s = w2s(1, 0), t = w2s(0, 1);\n    ctx.font = '600 11.5px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.44)';\n    ctx.textAlign = 'center'; ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n    ctx.fillText('e₁', s[0] - 4, s[1] + 15);\n    ctx.fillText('e₂', t[0] - 15, t[1] + 4);\n  }\n\n  function columnLabel(vec, text, color){\n    const o = w2s(0, 0);\n    const tip = w2s(vec[0], vec[1]);\n    const dx = tip[0] - o[0], dy = tip[1] - o[1];\n    const len = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\n    let mx, my;\n    if (len < 12){\n      mx = tip[0] + 30; my = tip[1] - 24;\n    } else {\n      const nx = -dy/len, ny = dx/len;\n      mx = o[0] + dx*0.60 + nx*17;\n      my = o[1] + dy*0.60 + ny*17;\n    }\n    pillLabel(mx, my, text, color, color + '66');\n  }\n\n  function drawColumns(){\n    const c1 = [A.a, A.c];\n    const c2 = [A.b, A.d];\n    drawArrow(0, 0, c1[0], c1[1], C.c1, 4, null, 14);\n    drawArrow(0, 0, c2[0], c2[1], C.c2, 4, null, 14);\n    columnLabel(c1, 'col 1 = A e₁', C.c1);\n    columnLabel(c2, 'col 2 = A e₂', C.c2);\n  }\n\n  function drawProbeSystem(){\n    const c1 = [A.a, A.c];\n    const c2 = [A.b, A.d];\n    const px = [c1[0]*probe.x, c1[1]*probe.x];       // x · col1\n    const img = tf(probe.x, probe.y);                // Ax\n\n    // decomposition: origin -> x·col1 -> x·col1 + y·col2 = Ax\n    const a0 = w2s(0, 0), a1 = w2s(px[0], px[1]), a2 = w2s(img[0], img[1]);\n    drawArrowPx(a0[0], a0[1], a1[0], a1[1], 'rgba(255,95,150,0.92)', 3, [7,5], 10);\n    drawArrowPx(a1[0], a1[1], a2[0], a2[1], 'rgba(63,199,255,0.92)', 3, [7,5], 10);\n\n    // image of probe\n    drawArrow(0, 0, img[0], img[1], C.image, 4.5, null, 16);\n    pillLabel(a2[0] + 30, a2[1] - 16, 'Ax', C.image, 'rgba(92,240,138,0.45)');\n\n    // probe itself\n    drawArrow(0, 0, probe.x, probe.y, C.probe, 3.5, null, 13);\n    const tipP = w2s(probe.x, probe.y);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(tipP[0], tipP[1], 7, 0, Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fillStyle = C.probe; ctx.fill();\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2; ctx.strokeStyle = '#0b1020'; ctx.stroke();\n    pillLabel(tipP[0] - 26, tipP[1] - 20, 'x', C.probe, 'rgba(255,194,71,0.45)');\n  }\n\n  function draw(){\n    ctx.setTransform(DPR, 0, 0, DPR, 0, 0);\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#0b1020';\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n    const bg = ctx.createRadialGradient(ox, oy, 20, ox, oy, Math.max(W, H) * 0.8);\n    bg.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(32,48,86,0.55)');\n    bg.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(8,12,22,0)');\n    ctx.fillStyle = bg;\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n\n    drawOriginalGrid();\n    drawTransformedGrid();\n    drawGhostSquare();\n    drawParallelogram();\n    drawBasisGhosts();\n    drawColumns();\n    drawProbeSystem();\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- UI sync ---------------- */\n  function syncUI(){\n    els.ma.textContent = A.a.toFixed(1);\n    els.mb.textContent = A.b.toFixed(1);\n    els.mc.textContent = A.c.toFixed(1);\n    els.md.textContent = A.d.toFixed(1);\n    els.sa.value = A.a.toFixed(1);\n    els.sb.value = A.b.toFixed(1);\n    els.sc.value = A.c.toFixed(1);\n    els.sd.value = A.d.toFixed(1);\n    els.oa.textContent = A.a.toFixed(1);\n    els.ob.textContent = A.b.toFixed(1);\n    els.oc.textContent = A.c.toFixed(1);\n    els.od.textContent = A.d.toFixed(1);\n\n    const D = det();\n    els.detval.textContent = (Math.abs(D) < 0.005 ? 0 : D).toFixed(2);\n    els.detformula.textContent = '= ad − bc = (' + A.a.toFixed(1) + ')(' + A.d.toFixed(1) +\n      ') − (' + A.b.toFixed(1) + ')(' + A.c.toFixed(1) + ')';\n\n    if (Math.abs(D) > 0.02){\n      let txt = 'area scaled by |det| = ' + Math.abs(D).toFixed(2);\n      if (D < 0){ txt += '  ·  orientation flipped'; }\n      els.status.textContent = txt;\n      els.status.className = 'status ' + (D < 0 ? 'flip' : 'ok');\n    } else {\n      els.status.textContent = 'collapsed onto a line (det = 0) — the columns are parallel';\n      els.status.className = 'status collapsed';\n    }\n\n    const img = tf(probe.x, probe.y);\n    els.pxv.textContent = '(' + probe.x.toFixed(2) + ', ' + probe.y.toFixed(2) + ')';\n    els.axv.textContent = '(' + img[0].toFixed(2) + ', ' + img[1].toFixed(2) + ')';\n  }\n\n  function refresh(){\n    syncUI();\n    dirty = true;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- sliders ---------------- */\n  [['sa','a'], ['sb','b'], ['sc','c'], ['sd','d']].forEach(function(pair){\n    const el = document.getElementById(pair[0]);\n    el.addEventListener('input', function(){\n      tween = null;\n      const v = parseFloat(el.value);\n      A[pair[1]] = isNaN(v) ? 0 : v;\n      refresh();\n    });\n  });\n\n  /* ---------------- presets + tween ---------------- */\n  const PRESETS = {\n    shear:    { a:1, b:1,  c:0, d:1 },\n    rotate:   { a:0, b:-1, c:1, d:0 },\n    project:  { a:1, b:0,  c:0, d:0 },\n    scale2:   { a:2, b:0,  c:0, d:2 },\n    reflect:  { a:0, b:1,  c:1, d:0 },\n    collapse: { a:1, b:2,  c:2, d:4 }\n  };\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.pbtn').forEach(function(btn){\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      const t = PRESETS[btn.dataset.preset];\n      if (!t) return;\n      tween = {\n        from: { a:A.a, b:A.b, c:A.c, d:A.d },\n        to:   { a:t.a, b:t.b, c:t.c, d:t.d },\n        t0: performance.now(),\n        dur: 520\n      };\n    });\n  });\n\n  function easeInOutCubic(p){\n    return p < 0.5 ? 4*p*p*p : 1 - Math.pow(-2*p + 2, 3)/2;\n  }\n\n  function stepTween(now){\n    const p = Math.min(1, (now - tween.t0) / tween.dur);\n    const e = easeInOutCubic(p);\n    ['a','b','c','d'].forEach(function(k){\n      A[k] = tween.from[k] + (tween.to[k] - tween.from[k]) * e;\n    });\n    if (p >= 1){\n      ['a','b','c','d'].forEach(function(k){ A[k] = tween.to[k]; });\n      tween = null;\n    }\n    refresh();\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- probe dragging ---------------- */\n  let dragging = false;\n\n  function moveProbeTo(ev){\n    const r = cv.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const w = s2w(ev.clientX - r.left, ev.clientY - r.top);\n    const maxX = Math.max(0.6, (W/2)/scale - 0.35);\n    const maxY = Math.max(0.6, (H/2)/scale - 0.35);\n    probe.x = Math.max(-maxX, Math.min(maxX, w[0]));\n    probe.y = Math.max(-maxY, Math.min(maxY, w[1]));\n    // snap to a tidy 0.05 lattice so the readout stays readable\n    probe.x = Math.round(probe.x * 20) / 20;\n    probe.y = Math.round(probe.y * 20) / 20;\n    refresh();\n  }\n\n  cv.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(ev){\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    dragging = true;\n    try { cv.setPointerCapture(ev.pointerId); } catch(e){}\n    moveProbeTo(ev);\n  });\n  cv.addEventListener('pointermove', function(ev){\n    if (!dragging) return;\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    moveProbeTo(ev);\n  });\n  cv.addEventListener('pointerup', function(ev){\n    dragging = false;\n    try { cv.releasePointerCapture(ev.pointerId); } catch(e){}\n  });\n  cv.addEventListener('pointercancel', function(){ dragging = false; });\n\n  /* ---------------- loop ---------------- */\n  function loop(now){\n    if (tween){ stepTween(now); }\n    if (dirty){ dirty = false; draw(); }\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------------- boot ---------------- */\n  if (window.ResizeObserver){\n    new ResizeObserver(function(){ resize(); }).observe(stage);\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n  resize();\n  refresh();\n  draw();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n\n  /* ---------------- test hooks ---------------- */\n  window.__state = function(){\n    return {\n      A: { a:A.a, b:A.b, c:A.c, d:A.d },\n      det: det(),\n      probe: { x:probe.x, y:probe.y },\n      ax: tf(probe.x, probe.y),\n      tweening: !!tween,\n      status: els.status.textContent,\n      W: W, H: H, scale: scale\n    };\n  };\n  window.__set = function(a, b, c, d){\n    tween = null;\n    A.a = a; A.b = b; A.c = c; A.d = d;\n    refresh();\n    draw();\n    return window.__state();\n  };\n  window.__setProbe = function(x, y){\n    probe.x = x; probe.y = y;\n    refresh(); draw();\n    return window.__state();\n  };\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
		"tested": true,
		"notes": "Verified with a headless run — no console errors, and the degenerate/flip/normal cases all render and report correctly.\n\n**Notes for the teacher:** The canvas shows the plane with a faint reference grid and the grid transformed by A (clipped, so it never breaks at any setting); a dashed ghost unit square sits under the translucent violet parallelogram its columns span, with bold pink/blue arrows labeled \"col 1 = A e₁\" and \"col 2 = A e₂\" plus faint dashed originals of e₁/e₂. Four sliders (a, b, c, d, −2…2, step 0.1) drive it all live and drive the 2×2 matrix readout, whose entries are color-coded to their column; six preset buttons tween in ~0.5 s, and the det strip flips to red \"collapsed onto a line — the columns are parallel\" near det = 0. Try dragging the amber probe x anywhere on the canvas — the dashed pink and blue segments show x·col₁ then + y·col₂ landing exactly on Ax, which is the fastest way to make \"the columns build every image\" click, then hit \"collapse\" to watch the whole plane squash onto a line."
	},
